 ### A01-P02
-The CIA wants this ship to retrieve part of a Soviet submarine from more than three miles down. Getting hold of the wreck is only half the problem. Bringing recognizable submarine wreckage into public view could expose the operation.
+The CIA wants part of that wreck brought up from more than three miles down. But the ship cannot simply lift recognizable submarine wreckage over the side. It has to bring its cargo aboard without showing the observers what it has found.
 
 ### A01-P03
